  "notes": "{返品|へんぴん} means returning purchased goods to the seller. The kanji are {返|へん} (return) + {品|ぴん} (goods). It functions as a noun and ⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧ verb.\n\nCOMMON EXPRESSIONS:\n- {返品|へんぴん}⟦する→する：00392_suru⟧: to return goods\n- {返品|へんぴん}⟦{可|か}→可：noentry⟧: returnable\n- {返品|へんぴん}⟦{不可|ふか}→不可：01922_fuka⟧: non-returnable\n- {返品|へんぴん}⟦{期限|きげん}→期限：12861_kigen⟧: return deadline\n- {返品|へんぴん}⟦{手続|てつづ}き→手続き：05453_tetsuzuki⟧: return procedure\n- {返品|へんぴん}⟦を→を：00422_wo⟧⟦{受|う}け{付|つ}ける→受け付ける：05683_uketsukeru⟧: to accept returns\n\nSHOPPING CONTEXT:\nOnline shopping (⟦{通販|つうはん}→通販：17464_tsuuhan⟧) sites typically have {返品|へんぴん}ポリシー (return policies). Common conditions include ⟦{未開封|みかいふう}→未開封：10677_mikaifuu⟧ (unopened) and ⟦{期限|きげん}→期限：12861_kigen⟧⟦{内|ない}→〜内：09853_nai⟧ (within the deadline).\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- ⟦{返金|へんきん}→返金：06130_henkin⟧: refund (money back)\n- ⟦{交換|こうかん}→交換：02746_koukan⟧: exchange (swap for different item)\n- ⟦{返却|へんきゃく}→返却：03149_henkyaku⟧: return (of borrowed items, not purchases)",
